WEBVTT

NOTE
Captions of "Core Replay: the life of a room". The film is silent: these are the words shown on screen, one per step, written by the recorder
(scripts/media/record-product-film.mjs) above the demonstration; each step was verified by its proof before its words appeared.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.930
Every room has a story. This one starts as a request.

2
00:00:03.930 --> 00:00:07.380
Nine requirements, six of them must-haves. Everything later is judged against them.

3
00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:10.030
Designed: every device a numbered position.

4
00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:14.990
The same room in Lite: one record, another view.

5
00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:18.370
Installed: position PA-0007 holds asset AS-0097.

6
00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:21.010
Each test recorded, then verified by someone else.

7
00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:23.670
Baseline v1: what the room was proven to do.

8
00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:27.310
AS-0097 out, AS-0112 in. Only the tests that name PA-0007 reopen.

9
00:00:27.310 --> 00:00:29.940
Re-accepted: baseline v2 is current, and v1 is kept.

10
00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.310
From here on, Assurance watches the room against that baseline.
